{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Drift update after origin/main refresh: the model-class refactor this design anticipated has LANDED. (1) afeb-bc04 and 7a79 — cited in the description as open bugs — are both CLOSED; hand-built sub-calls now route through the model-class config and the 4096-token prompt-cache floor is handled. (2) The durable seam for the stage-1 screen is now src/rebar/llm/model_classes.py: use TRIVIAL_CLASS ('trivial') + resolve_model_string() rather than hard-coding 'haiku' — completion.py:289 already resolves STANDARD_CLASS the same way, so the screen follows the established pattern. (3) REBAR_LLM_MODEL is deprecated (d23e) — do not reference it. Design otherwise unchanged; verifier's native show_ticket tool and the DET direct-children gate (completion.py:98-:185 blocking/uncertified findings) verified intact on current main."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785706552635156001,"uuid":"8ae502a9-eddb-4063-be86-9c79a7fc3f42"}